__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
**/modules/*/**/receipts/    # modules/ nests under the active profile's own folder (factory.yaml paths.modules)
*.orig

# macOS Finder metadata — never content
.DS_Store

# Derived current-state — `_state/` mixes two things, and only these are caches.
# `build_state()` rewrites every one of them from the v{N}/ sources on EVERY run
# (`_prepare` calls it before any stage), so running pass 2 rewrote pass 1's files
# and every diff carried that noise — hiding the real change. Verified regenerable
# byte-for-byte. NOT ignored, because nothing can rebuild them: `approvals/`,
# `gate-pass-*` (human approval), `analyze-*` (the evidence a gate was passed) and
# `briefs/` (what an implementer was actually handed).
**/_state/current-*.md
**/_state/traceability.md
**/_state/state.json
